Third-party material
--------------------

The Classic Era quest data in Data/Classic/ is derived from the quest database
of Questie (https://github.com/Questie/Questie), which is distributed under the
GNU General Public License version 3.

Modifications made by Ironship, 30 August 2026:

  * Quest titles and objective text were extracted for Classic Era quest ids
    and rewritten into this addon's own Lua table format.
  * Fields this addon does not use -- quest givers, coordinates, level and
    faction requirements, quest chains, reward tables and objective spawn
    data -- were dropped.
  * No quest text was altered. Where the upstream database has no offer text
    for a quest, this addon has none either and says so rather than inventing
    one.

The extraction is performed by Tools/extract_classic_quests.lua, which is part
of the corresponding source of this work.

